|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | `exec-81748864…` | accept | 실행 **실패** — `CreateProcess { message: "Rejected(\"Failed to create unified exec process: orchestrator_helper_launch_canceled: ShellExecuteExW failed to launch setup helper: 1223\")" }` |
